**Goal:** Install Gotify for fallback notifications when Discord is unavailable.
**Dependencies:** P2-019 | **Cost:** $0 | **ADR:** ADR-022 | **AC:** AC-DISCORD-003 | **Time:** 2h each

**P2-020: Gotify Installation**
