| `/home/guinevere/evidence/` | Implementation evidence |
| `/home/guinevere/scripts/` | Utility scripts |
| `/home/guinevere/secrets/` | SOPS age keys (NEVER commit) |
| `/home/guinevere/backups/` | Local backup staging |

